---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Add a to-do from a message yourself

Usage: mxr todo add [OPTIONS] --from <MESSAGE_ID> --title <TITLE>

Options:
      --from <MESSAGE_ID>  The message it's about
      --title <TITLE>      What to do, starting with the verb: "Send the signed form"
      --due <DUE>          When it's due: "fri", "9 oct", "in 2w"
      --kind <KIND>        bill, renewal, sign, rsvp, promise, other, ... (default other)
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
